    "'Partial structural progress' for general plants is not substantiated. Outside min(m,p)=1 (no relations, purely linear) and m=p=2, Theorem A gives no new decision power. The stable variant contains SOF stabilization and remains a QE-type problem; the manuscript says this itself in Section 4."
